se diagnostic scheduling with tolerance 0.5\n2. Grid refinement arrest if \u0394C5 < 0.0005 for two levels\n3. Coarsen grid to top-performing resolution\n\nFallback recovery:\n```python\ndef recovering_fallback(current_n):\n    if parent_available and current_n != n_orig:\n        coarser = upsample_h(best_overall, n_level, current_n)\n    else:\n        coarser = initial_h_values.copy()\n    return coarser\n```",
